Maintainer: MyGdrive Rust contributors
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: mygdrive-rust
Architecture: any
Depends: @DEPENDS@, fuse3, python3, xdg-utils, pkexec, apt
Recommends: gvfs, libnotify-bin
Suggests: thunar, zenity
Description: Google Drive desktop client written in Rust
 MyGdrive Rust provides a GTK 4 dashboard, a command-line sync engine,
 preserve-both conflict handling, and an optional on-demand FUSE drive.
 Google OAuth desktop credentials are supplied by the user.
